{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44861","headline":"冬日诸禅自商山礼正师真塔回见访 · 无可","name":"冬日诸禅自商山礼正师真塔回见访","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"久思今忽来，双屦汚青苔。\n拂雪从山起，过房礼塔回。\n偈留闲夜作，禅请暂时开。\n欲作孤云去，赋诗余不才。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无可","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44861.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44861","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}